{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>圓通速遞9日發佈《關於颱風、暴雨天氣告客户書》，明確表示：\"受極端天氣影響，我們在以上部分地區的上門取件、快件中轉、派送時效將受到不同程度的影響。\" 圓通同時承諾，將密切關注天氣變化，全力做好快件安全防範和服務工作，儘快將快件安全送達。</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>中通快遞、百世快運、韻達快遞等也發佈類似告知書，提醒客户近期寄遞時效可能出現波動。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/4f0fc7bb74303a9.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/0c937b9ad7b019c.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/5b2016cc81b6ef0.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/00b55012b958b88.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/cd167d3362150de.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/4f0fc7bb74303a9.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/0c937b9ad7b019c.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/5b2016cc81b6ef0.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0710/00b55012b958b88.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-09T22:58:36.127473+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":9,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}